// 可向量化形状的环（AXPY、矩阵乘内环）照常编译为标量代码：原生编译器曾按 Zig 版的 SIMD 识别整程序拒绝（E006）。
const N: int = 6;

function idx(i: int, j: int): int {
    return i * N + j;
}

export function main(args: []string): int {
    // y[i] = y[i] + a * x[i]
    const x: List< float> = listNew();
    const y: List< float> = listNew();
    let i: int = 0;
    while (i < 8) {
        listPush(x, i as float * 0.5);
        listPush(y, 1.0);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    const a: float = 2.0;
    i = 0;
    while (i < 8) {
        const yv: float = listGet(y, i) catch 0.0;
        listSet(y, i, yv + a * (listGet(x, i) catch 0.0));
        i = i + 1;
    }
    let sum: float = 0.0;
    i = 0;
    while (i < 8) {
        sum = sum + (listGet(y, i) catch 0.0);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    print("axpy=" + toStr(sum));
    // 矩阵乘（平铺一维 List，同 bench/algo/matmul）
    const ma: List< float> = listNew();
    const mb: List< float> = listNew();
    const mc: List< float> = listNew();
    i = 0;
    while (i < N * N) {
        listPush(ma, (i % 5) as float * 0.5);
        listPush(mb, (i % 3) as float * 0.25 + 0.5);
        listPush(mc, 0.0);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    let r: int = 0;
    while (r < N) {
        let k: int = 0;
        while (k < N) {
            const av: float = listGet(ma, idx(r, k)) catch 0.0;
            let cc: int = 0;
            while (cc < N) {
                const cv: float = listGet(mc, idx(r, cc)) catch 0.0;
                listSet(mc, idx(r, cc), cv + av * (listGet(mb, idx(k, cc)) catch 0.0));
                cc = cc + 1;
            }
            k = k + 1;
        }
        r = r + 1;
    }
    let diag: float = 0.0;
    let total: float = 0.0;
    i = 0;
    while (i < N * N) {
        total = total + (listGet(mc, i) catch 0.0);
        if (i % (N + 1) == 0) { diag = diag + (listGet(mc, i) catch 0.0); }
        i = i + 1;
    }
    print("diag=" + toStr(diag) + " total=" + toStr(total));
    // 整数版：z[i] = z[i] + 3 * w[i]
    const w: List< int> = listNew();
    const z: List< int> = listNew();
    i = 0;
    while (i < 10) {
        listPush(w, i);
        listPush(z, 100 - i);
        i = i + 1;
    }
    i = 0;
    while (i < 10) {
        const zv: int = listGet(z, i) catch 0;
        listSet(z, i, zv + 3 * (listGet(w, i) catch 0));
        i = i + 1;
    }
    let isum: int = 0;
    for (v in z) { isum = isum + v; }
    print("int=" + toStr(isum));
    return 0;
}
